[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    169[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    170[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// Runs both programs on `input` and asserts stdout, stderr and exit status all
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    171[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// match byte for byte.
