[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    246[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// M0 + S1 + S5: nothing to read, so x stays 0.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    247[0m:[38;5;10m[49m #[test]
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    248[0m:[38;5;10m[49m fn m0_empty_input() {
